WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.084
On the Install page, go to the Windows
section.

2
00:00:04.654 --> 00:00:08.142
Choose Download the Windows installer.

3
00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:14.377
About 120 megabytes, saved with the
version in its name.

4
00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:21.318
When it finishes, the panel shows Open
file, and the installer is ready to run.
